          <p>If you missed the last bus, you may refuse to board the boat, so please be prepared with time in mind. So please come having margin at time.<br>
          <strong>If you want to go to Terminal 1 after arriving, please use this bus.<br>
            <span class="txt-red">*Walking in Sunflower Terminal is strictly prohibited.</span></strong></p>
          <p class="ttl02">Bus timetable when you get off the ship (Duration: about 5 minutes)</p>
        <div class="tbl-scrollWrap">
          <table class="w600 alignC td-c">
            <tr>
              <th class="w200">&nbsp;</th>
              <th>Departure from Terminal 2</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th class="th3">1st departure</th>
              <td>10-minutes later from a leaving a ship start</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th class="th3">After the 2nd departure</th>
              <td>Depart as soon as the customer gets on</td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </div><!--/.tbl-scrollWrap-->
          <hr>
          <p class="ttl">From Kansai International Airport</p>
          <p>Take the limousine bus bound for Osaka Nanko and get off at "Hyatt Regency Osaka".<br>
          Please click <a href="http://www.kate.co.jp/en/timetable/detail/NU" target="_blank" class="window">here</a> for timetable.<br>
          From there you will arrive at the Terminal１ in 10 minutes on foot. we will pick you up from the elevator building to the Terminal 2 with a free shuttle bus.</p>
          <p class="ttl">From Itami Domestic Airport</p>
          <p>Go to "Namba" by limousine bus. Please click <a href="https://www.okkbus.co.jp/en/timetable/N/" target="_blank" class="window">here</a> for timetable.<br>
          Transfer to Midosuji subway line and get off at "Honmachi" station. From there transfer to Chuo subway line and take the train to "Cosmosquare" station. Transfer to Newtram line and take the newtram to "Trade Center" station. From there you will arrive at the Terminal１ in 5 minutes on foot. we will pick you up from the elevator building to the Terminal 2 with a free shuttle bus.</p>
          <hr>
            
          <h3>By car</h3>
          <p class="ttl">From Osaka City</p>
          <p>Take the &quot;Nanko Kita&quot; exit on the Hanshin Expressway Wangan Line. The terminal is a 15-minute drive away.</p>
          <p class="ttl">From Kansai International Airport</p>
          <p>Take the &quot;Nanko  Minami&quot; exit on the Hanshin Expressway Wangan Line.The terminal is a 20-minute  drive away.</p>       

          
