Approx. 30 minutes from Kushima City on Route 220</p>

<p class="ttl">From Kagoshima City, Kokubu exit</p>
<p>Approx. 90 minutes from Kokubu City via Route 10 and Prefecture Route 63</p>

<p class="ttl">From Kagoshima City, Takarabe Sueyoshi exit</p>
<p>Approx. 35 minutes on Prefecture Route 63 from Higashi Kyushu Expressway Soyagoro IC</p>

          <h3>From Airport</h3>
          <p class="ttl">From Kagoshima Airport</p>
          <p>Take the Kagoshima-Airport Limousine Bus [Kagoshimachuo] (For Kosoku-Center-Minaru) and get off at "Kagoshimachuoeki ".<br>
          Travel time is approximately 38 minutes and the cost of a ticket is JPY1250.<br>
          Transfer to <a href="/en/route/osaka-shibushi/boarding/doc/sunflower-liner.pdf" class="pdf" target="_blank">Sunflower liner</a>.</p>


